# Copy to .env for your own local reference only — nothing in this project actually reads a
# .env file. The frontend build reads real environment variables directly (set in the Vercel
# dashboard); local dev uses frontend/js/config.js instead (see README.md). This file is just a
# convenient place to park both values before pasting them into Vercel's Environment Variables.
#
# Get both values from your Supabase project's Settings → API Keys, specifically the
# "Legacy anon, service_role API keys" tab — not the newer "Publishable and secret API keys"
# tab's sb_publishable_... key, which 401s against the pinned supabase-js version this project
# uses (see backend/README.md for why).
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
